          "required": false,
          "note": "Optional (+) — informational: the Paris System is deliberately built around detecting high-grade urothelial carcinoma specifically; LGUN is a distinct, separate category since low-grade lesions are frequently not reliably distinguishable from reactive change on cytology alone. Cite local institutional risk data where available.",
